---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Accessibility" description="Accessibility statement for the North Kitsap United website." heroTitle="Accessibility">
  

  <section class="card">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="prose">
        <p class="text-sm text-nku-gray-light">Effective Date: March 19, 2026</p>

        <p>
          The <strong>Rotary Club of Kingston North Kitsap</strong>, operating this website publicly as <strong>North Kitsap United</strong>, is committed to improving the accessibility of this website for all visitors.
        </p>
        <p>
          We aim to make the North Kitsap United website accessible and usable for as many people as possible, including people using assistive technologies.
        </p>

        <h2>Our Commitment</h2>
        <p>
          We aim to follow the <strong>Web Content Accessibility Guidelines (WCAG) 2.2 Level AA</strong> as a guide for ongoing accessibility improvements.
        </p>
        <p>
          Accessibility is an ongoing effort. We recognize that some parts of the website may not yet be fully accessible at all times, especially as content changes, third-party materials are added, or embedded tools are used.
        </p>

        <h2>Ongoing Improvement</h2>
        <p>We are committed to ongoing efforts to improve accessibility, which may include:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Reviewing website content and structure</li>
          <li>Improving headings, labels, and navigation</li>
          <li>Supporting keyboard navigation where practical</li>
          <li>Improving color contrast and readability</li>
          <li>Reviewing images and media for accessible alternatives where feasible</li>
          <li>Considering accessibility when adding new content, documents, forms, and embedded media</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>Third-Party Content</h2>
        <p>
          Some parts of this website may rely on third-party tools or content, such as embedded videos, downloadable PDFs, maps, or form providers. While we may not control all third-party accessibility features, we will make reasonable efforts to choose and use tools in a way that supports accessibility.
        </p>

        <h2>Feedback and Assistance</h2>
        <p>
          If you experience difficulty accessing any part of this website, notice an accessibility barrier, or need information in an alternate format, please contact us:
        </p>
        <p>
          <strong>Email:</strong> <a href="mailto:kingstonsportscomplex@gmail.com">kingstonsportscomplex@gmail.com</a>
        </p>
        <p>When reaching out, it may help to include:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>The webpage or feature you were trying to use</li>
          <li>A description of the problem</li>
          <li>The device, browser, or assistive technology you were using, if relevant</li>
        </ul>
        <p>
          We welcome feedback and will use it to support ongoing accessibility improvements.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
